{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:30 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪產女後首曝光素顏圓潤美  踢爆育兒謊言大呻餵母乳超痛苦 大仔完美遺傳媽媽基因\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/0c07c9c800b420c0308cbedadf1798c9/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__121.png\"/>\n<p>朱千雪早前順利誕下第二胎女兒，成功湊成一個「好」字。近日朱千雪在社交平台分享產後首次曝光的素顏近照，相中的她雖然仍未完全修身，面部顯得有些許圓潤，但皮膚依然白皙滑溜，整體狀態好到爆燈。朱千雪發表了產後在過去兩周內的想法：「社交媒體說從1到2個孩子容易過0到1個孩子。不要相信社交媒體告訴你的每一件事。」藉此打破網絡上對多子家庭輕鬆育兒的幻想。而相中亦罕有曝光了大仔的側顏，網民驚嘆大仔的五官和神態與朱千雪簡直一模一樣，完美遺傳了媽媽的神級美貌基因。</p>\n<h2>朱千雪大呻餵母乳辛苦</h2>\n<p>朱千雪坦率地道出無數母乳媽媽的心聲，直言自己依舊很不適應餵哺母乳：「我仍然不喜歡母乳餵養。它基本上是一份全職工作，很痛苦。母親堅持獨自母乳餵養一段時間，應該獲得獎項。」引來網民和媽媽們的強烈共鳴。朱千雪透露一邊要照顧初生囡囡，一邊還要兼顧大仔的需求，每天的生活步調都像在打一份極具考驗的「全職工作」，但看著大仔貼心地陪伴在側，也不禁發出會心微笑。</p>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪一家三口變一家四口。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/175772f4354d0bddb6247e37e618ba09/2026-05/tracytschu_1779022387_3899044037222933322_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪第二胎出生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fec344fcab1ab87417dd373ceab0ce1f/2026-11/tracytschu_1794393389_4027985415857890554_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪今年5月在IG分享陀第二胎喜悅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94f270f87d5ea4b729cbed23b5d4f1ba/2026-05/tracytschu_1779022387_3899044032810340101_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪早前誕下女兒，湊成一個「好」字。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0873252ab542c750ea4c1fbff846c4e3/2025-11/z01_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪在哺乳椅上溫馨一拖二，大仔貼心陪伴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e82e92ba76fdfa18439ecfac5129ecfa/2026-11/SaveClip_App_921526040_18648514612052031_6805612543719702489_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪素顏嘟嘴與初生寶貝同框，皮膚白皙透亮，被網民大讚是「最強素顏媽媽」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f3c00417b5234dd61dc7d3463f64878/2026-11/SaveClip_App_925173421_18648514609052031_6894394686651310352_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大仔溫柔地看著剛出世的妹妹，朱千雪隨手拍下的兄妹同框畫面非常有愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d61b1a34eb794d741609e1bf4c06a551/2026-11/SaveClip_App_925241444_18648514630052031_9049362771633447535_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前與湯洛雯及岑杏賢相約為蔣家旻慶祝生日，她開心表示姊妹們生日都會相約慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87e3131e5247eb0c1e9dd8226d6461b7/2025-11/z02_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪產後身形甚FIT。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe965b7601f66ac06b165d6f553ea2dd/2024-10/01_18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪回加拿大探親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/637118f8b17af6174055f4d33c6ba0ee/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709902417661_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪笑得十分燦爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e136be7e3fc5d91dcd083242ebd1134/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709868853139_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪分享自拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35a02afd805a86aed365ef536edf8c47/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709877239204_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪與老公十分甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3db146d585116d3c1c67da252d30609/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709893997616_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪返加拿大享受當地美食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e50f19e6d48862e144e1fc2e3d6dbc71/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709894050164_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪帶兒子回加拿大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7870548566dd78b7a04c797ad56a43e6/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709910793992_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪淡出幕前並轉行做大律師。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/137e1e7e20392d36fbb383b1e805f544/2023-11/tracytschu_1695745209_3200465238910981784_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪早前罕晒夫妻合照賀結婚4周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0384e1dc585ec78080b5596eac904b1c/2023-08/tracytschu_364977797_3465946453692764_4144238412241533214_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪與老公出生日子只差3天，二人在同醫院、同房出生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47e8b643e2b44f4213c2acd4dd13bf54/2023-08/tracytschu_84363591_202114407606669_2864271347493673354_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狀態比以前更加好！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db2d71a0bef47a7e7fb31f8d06349326/2023-11/tracytschu_1697955039_3219002638790910397_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪早前受邀去到羅湖懲教所。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/585403d535a3575a83c28f8035ecf82a/2026-01/tracytschu_1769775920_3821479809021709058_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<h2>朱千雪坦言24小時照顧小孩</h2>\n<p>朱千雪指當全世界都在勸她產後要多些休息時，精力充沛的大仔卻有著完全不同的想法。她表示：「孩子在想『你會一直待在家裡嗎？讓我們24/7玩，永遠不睡覺。』，最近有很多母子時間。」雖然大仔瘋狂纏著媽媽，讓她累得不可開交，但看著兩名孩子，朱千雪內心依然感到無比溫馨，最後感性地總結：「我的心總是充滿愛，雖然我曾經質疑父母如何能夠讓一個孩子的愛變得更自然。」字裡行間洋溢著滿滿的幸福，母愛滿溢。</p>\n<img alt=\"老公視覺的朱千雪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf352e47136df111d760911254d3cc81/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709910829517_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪老公身處郊外面貼面自拍照，十分sweet！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42777595658112b2bf43615fee4eb4e6/2025-12/tracytschu_1766067659_3790372709919194203_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪赴日出席蔣家旻的婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7dc09879c287d8e689b5dd855f69705/2024-10/461418889_454916887579128_5502073848420492929_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪提醒蔣家旻要好好享受二人世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f2d369ac4d793dfea8d154b3c6891f0/2024-10/thumbnail_22__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪早前現身Art Basel，身體狀態惹起熱議。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a4ca835a152b27a32ec6e4e198bf963/2025-03/1_0_62.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪分享近日到越南旅遊的美照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e9d9d9c871d6b52b873ab61231a07bb/2025-08/a_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪幾乎全程穿大肚裙，孕味極濃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b3721209a682ec9ca53d9f5326dc50b/2025-08/b_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪身形較之前豐滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6355d565ae19ded054ffbd7731457878/2025-08/c_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪盡顯母愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71278cae20b6028da895028239eb6363/2025-08/d_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪被封為民選港姐冠軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e975af41444d426785e9075f147d91f0/2025-08/f_0_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪同家人早前去首爾旅遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4cef57c291171ffe27a79ea62ffefebf/2024-12/470893959_1546584776735079_6733548443690910322_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪同家人早前去首爾旅遊，老公為朱千雪孭BB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29e62f9a436af13755fff75c113886f7/2024-12/470918818_515146394869356_1039602348238569439_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪和醫生老公吳昆倫出席蔣家旻的婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33404a537248c1cb16a759693cb15b85/2024-10/Snapinsta_app_434565798_1140178610329409_5184848352934273478_n_1080.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「升呢」人母嘅朱千雪上圍升cup。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/467a454bf22e3b91d5a3ebb5941d97e1/2024-10/thumbnail_7__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"千雪勤力做運動修身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5dd81b13e2c31c67848878d6028524e9/2024-10/thumbnail_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"其實朱千雪產後經已瘦咗好多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66268b4f57a2c146b041e19c0ce4da99/2024-10/thumbnail_25__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪爭取機會外遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b951ea226f73245e8391f12f7ce57e4/2024-09/tracytschu_1726324978_3456986940451878773_268532030.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱千雪回復昔日狀態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a3ee23e0418fb7d42baf76335886934/2024-09/tracytschu_1726324978_3456986940552562732_268532030.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.511976+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":642,"images":39,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:39.006795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:37.084354+00:00","content_hash":"3961e6afe9baacc0639793c36f016487dac85ea10040d95393568b5fd189d69f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}